  "description": "MiniMax H3 on the 10Eros Max finetune with larryvrh's Turbo LoRA: six steps instead of twenty. Text-to-video, image-to-video and reference-to-video. Uses the same 10Eros Max weights as the plain pack, plus the Turbo LoRA - if you have the plain pack installed this costs one extra file.",
